WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The word says one color. The ink says another. Your brain wants to answer both.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a laboratory, a suggestion helped some highly suggestible people ignore the word.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In 2006, the effect did not require a hypnotic induction in that study.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A later review examined many experiments. It did not test your favorite audio product.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Enjoying a recording and proving better concentration are different questions.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before buying, try a free twelve-minute work block. Compare evidence, not promises.
